  "title": "Sampling evaluation worksheet",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Sampling evaluation worksheet</h2><p>Evaluate a control sample and a separate monetary sample using the specified methods.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs2-f1\">Observed control deviation rate, as a percentage</label><input id=\"aud-m3-tbs2-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs2-f2\">Conclusion using the upper deviation rate</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs2-f2\"><option value=\"Planned reliance is not supported\">Planned reliance is not supported</option><option value=\"Reliance is guaranteed\">Reliance is guaranteed</option><option value=\"Ignore the upper rate\">Ignore the upper rate</option><option value=\"No additional evaluation is needed\">No additional evaluation is needed</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs2-f3\">Sample monetary overstatement</label><input id=\"aud-m3-tbs2-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs2-f4\">Projected population overstatement</label><input id=\"aud-m3-tbs2-f4\" type=\"text\"></div></section>",
