  "explanation": "<h3>Observed control deviation rate, as a percentage</h3><p>4 ÷ 80 = 5%.</p><h3>Conclusion using the upper deviation rate</h3><p>The 8% upper rate exceeds the 6% tolerable rate.</p><h3>Sample monetary overstatement</h3><p>$80,000 recorded less $76,000 audited = $4,000.</p><h3>Projected population overstatement</h3><p>$4,000 ÷ $80,000 × $1,200,000 = $60,000.</p>"
